  ('being-kind-online', 227, 'Leave a sincere comment on a coworker''s professional post about something they learned.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 228, 'Write a short recommendation for a former colleague on a professional networking site, naming a skill you saw them use.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 229, 'Tell an online teacher or coach whose free videos helped you which skill you finally got.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 230, 'Rate a free printable, pattern or template you used, and thank the person who made it.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 231, 'Share someone''s fundraiser post with a sincere line, if it is a cause you trust.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 232, 'Welcome a new person in your neighborhood''s online group and mention a local spot they might like.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 233, 'Introduce two people in an online community who you think could help each other.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 234, 'Save a kind reply someone gave a beginner, and copy that tone in your next answer.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 235, 'Give your full attention to one message today, reading slowly before you reply.'),
