  ('being-kind-online', 290, 'Offer to help a parent in your class group chat with a question about the new school year.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 291, 'Write a new year message to a group chat thanking everyone for the laughs this past year.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 292, 'Think of one person who was kind to you online this year and send them a thank-you note.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 293, 'Leave a comment on a long post that shows you read to the end, quoting one line you liked.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 294, 'Thank a support group member who shared something brave with a gentle reply.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 295, 'Send a "this made my day" message to someone whose post made you laugh.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 296, 'Tell a stranger in a comment that their story helped you feel less alone.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 297, 'Praise the way a friend handled a disagreement in a group chat, privately.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 298, 'Highlight a teammate''s contribution in a comment on a shared document.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 299, 'Leave encouraging comments on a shared document instead of only corrections.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 300, 'Frame a suggestion in a shared document as a question: "What if we tried this?"'),
  ('being-kind-online', 301, 'Reply to a newcomer''s first post in a hobby group with a welcome and a question about their project.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 302, 'Answer a question you''ve answered many times before with fresh patience.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 303, 'Be the first to say "Welcome!" when someone new is added to a group chat.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 304, 'Explain an inside joke to someone new in a group chat so they feel included.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 305, 'Respond quickly to a friend''s worried message, even if it''s just "I''m here."'),
  ('being-kind-online', 306, 'Encourage someone who posted about a failed attempt with "Trying took courage."'),
  ('being-kind-online', 307, 'Write a short note to the person behind a local business''s social account, thanking them for helpful updates.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 308, 'Leave an honest, generous review for a family-run restaurant you visited recently.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 309, 'Thank a pharmacist, librarian or clerk through their workplace''s online feedback form.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 310, 'Report a fake review attacking a small business you know treats people well.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 311, 'Breathe out slowly and unclench your jaw before replying to criticism in a comment.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 312, 'Write your reply, then cut the first and last sentences, which often hold the sharpest words.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 313, 'Ask yourself whether you''d say it to their face, and edit your comment until the answer is yes.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 314, 'Reply to a message that hurt you with "Can you say more about what you meant?"'),
  ('being-kind-online', 315, 'Let one online misunderstanding pass today without needing to correct the record.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 316, 'Offer a respectful counterpoint with a source, then let the other person respond without replying again.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 317, 'Thank someone who disagreed with you civilly, saying you appreciated their tone.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 318, 'Delete your own reply in a comment war if it added heat rather than light.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 319, 'Turn down a friend''s invitation to gang up on someone in a chat, kindly but firmly.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 320, 'Avoid sharing photos of a stranger''s odd outfit, bad parking or rough day for laughs.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 321, 'Keep a friend''s secret off the group chat, even as a hint.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 322, 'Consider who might be hurt before you share a screenshot of any conversation.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 323, 'Check whether a health tip you''re about to share comes from a trustworthy source.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 324, 'Pause before reacting to a photo that seems too perfect to be real, and look for its origin.'),
