  ('being-kind-online', 342, 'Teach a younger cousin how to write a kind comment, using a real post you both admire.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 343, 'Help an older relative write and send their first message in the family group chat.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 344, 'Celebrate a coworker''s promotion with a sincere comment in the team channel.'),
  ('being-kind-online', 345, 'Comment on a friend''s graduation photos with a specific memory of their hard work.'),
