  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 1, 'Breathe in through your nose for a count of four and out through your mouth for a count of six, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 2, 'Rest one hand on your belly and let it rise like a small balloon as you breathe in, then sink as you breathe out, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 3, 'Sigh out loud once, letting your shoulders drop as the air leaves, then take two quiet breaths after it.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 4, 'Count each out-breath from one to ten at your desk, and if you lose your place, simply start over at one.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 5, 'Purse your lips as if cooling a spoonful of hot soup and let your next five out-breaths leave slowly through them.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 6, 'Hum a low, easy note on each exhale for five breaths and notice where you feel the buzz.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 7, 'Notice the cool air coming in at the tip of your nose and the warmer air going out, for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 8, 'Before you open your email this morning, take three slow breaths with your eyes resting on something far away.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 9, 'Try a gentle box breath: in for three, pause for three, out for three, pause for three, four rounds in all.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 10, 'Go at your own pace with every practice in this challenge; it is fine to skip a count or simply breathe normally.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 11, 'Place a hand flat on your chest and feel it lift and settle for five breaths while you wait for the kettle.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 12, 'Let each exhale be a little longer than the inhale before it, for six breaths, while you sit on the edge of your bed tonight.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 13, 'Follow ten breaths from start to finish, just watching them come and go without changing anything.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 14, 'Rest for a moment in the small pause after each exhale, five times, before the next breath arrives on its own.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 15, 'Walk slowly and breathe in for three steps and out for four steps, for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 16, 'Raise your arms slowly out to the sides as you breathe in, and lower them as you breathe out, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 17, 'Peel an orange or a lemon and breathe in the scent from the peel for four slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 18, 'Take three easy breaths before you answer the next phone call, letting the ring be your cue.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 19, 'Pause in the doorway of your kitchen this evening and take one unhurried breath before you step in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 20, 'At a red light, keep your eyes on the road and let one breath out a little slower than usual.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 21, 'Look at your plate before your first bite at lunch and take two slow breaths through your nose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 22, 'Sit beside your dog or cat and let your breath slow down to match their easy rhythm for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 23, 'Step outside your front door this morning and take four breaths of fresh air before the day begins.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 24, 'Put on a slow song you like and breathe in for one line of the lyrics and out for the next, through the whole song.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 25, 'Let the warm water of your shower hit your shoulders and breathe out slowly each time you feel it, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 26, 'Lie on your back in bed tonight, rest your hands on your belly, and count ten slow breaths before sleep.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 27, 'Before you reach for your phone on waking, take three long, easy breaths while still lying down.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 28, 'In a waiting room, quietly count your out-breaths up to twenty, letting each one be soft and unhurried.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 29, 'Before a conversation you are nervous about, take two breaths with a slow exhale, longer than the inhale.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 30, 'After a walk or a workout, stand still and let your breath slow on its own while you breathe out through your mouth.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 31, 'Step into the cool fall air this evening and notice how the first breath feels in your nose and chest.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 32, 'If you feel dizzy or lightheaded during any breathing practice, stop and breathe normally until it passes.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 33, 'Teach a child to smell the flower and blow out the candle: a slow sniff in, a soft blow out, five times together.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 34, 'Breathe in while you silently think the word here and out while you think now, for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 35, 'Rest your fingertips on your ribs at the sides and feel them widen gently as you breathe in, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 36, 'On the bus or train, choose a stop ahead and take slow breaths until you reach it, out a little longer than in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 37, 'Sit in your parked car before you go inside and take five breaths with your hands resting in your lap.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 38, 'Let your out-breath carry a soft ahh sound three times, as quiet or as audible as feels comfortable.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 39, 'Breathe in for a count of two and out for a count of four, ten times, while the coffee brews.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 40, 'Trace the outline of one hand with a finger of the other, breathing in as you go up each finger and out as you go down.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 41, 'Notice which part of your body moves first when you breathe in, belly, chest or shoulders, for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 42, 'Hold a warm mug of tea under your nose and take three breaths of the steam before you sip.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 43, 'Count backward from ten, one number on each out-breath, the next time you sit down at your desk.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 44, 'Drop your shoulders away from your ears on an exhale, then take three more breaths with them resting low.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 45, 'Picture your breath as a slow wave coming up the beach and going back out, for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 46, 'Wiggle your toes on the floor and take four slow breaths while feeling them press into the ground.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 47, 'Gently breathe in through your nose and out through your nose, letting the exhale take its time, for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 48, 'Pick one regular sound nearby, a fan or a clock, and let each exhale stretch across a few of its beats.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 49, 'Lay a light book on your belly while lying down and watch it rise and fall for ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 50, 'Every time you stand up from a chair today, take one slow breath before your first step.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 51, 'Sit tall, rest your palms on your knees, and take five breaths with a short, comfortable pause at the top.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 52, 'Before you knock or ring a bell at someone''s door, take one easy breath and let it out slowly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 53, 'Notice how your breath feels right now without changing it, then let the next three exhales lengthen a little.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 54, 'On a summer evening, sit outside and breathe in the warm air for six slow, easy breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 55, 'Close your eyes for five breaths at your desk and listen only to the sound of the air moving in and out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 56, 'Draw air in through your nose for three, then sigh out through your mouth for five, four times in a row.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 57, 'Rest your hands on your belly and your chest at once and breathe so the lower hand moves a little more, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 58, 'Wash your hands slowly at the sink and take one long breath out while the water runs.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 59, 'Put your forehead in your palms at your desk and take four slow breaths while your eyes rest.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 60, 'Hum a favorite tune softly on each out-breath for one minute, letting it be as quiet as you like.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 61, 'Brush your teeth tonight, then stand at the sink and take three slow breaths before you leave the bathroom.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 62, 'Before you get out of the car in a parking lot, take three breaths and let the last one be a long sigh.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 63, 'Imagine breathing in the color of a calm sky and breathing out a little of the day, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 64, 'Breathe out through your mouth as though fogging a window, gently and slowly, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 65, 'While a page loads or a file saves, take one slow breath instead of watching the screen.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 66, 'Spread your fingers wide on the in-breath and let them relax on the out-breath, eight times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 67, 'Look out a window and breathe in as your eyes move up a tree or building and out as they move down, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 68, 'Before you walk into school or work, take two breaths at the door with your feet planted.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 69, 'Sit quietly and count four breaths in which you notice nothing but the air leaving your nose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 70, 'Let your belly be soft on purpose for six breaths, no holding it in, just letting it move.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 71, 'Take five slow breaths by a window on a rainy day, matching your exhale to the sound of the rain.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 72, 'Notice your breath right before you fall asleep tonight and follow just three of them all the way out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 73, 'Look back over this challenge so far and pick the one breathing practice you liked best to do again today.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 74, 'Wrap a scarf over your nose and mouth on a cold winter morning and take four slow breaths of the warmed air.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 75, 'Step outside after a spring rain and breathe in the damp, fresh smell for five easy breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 76, 'Count three on the in-breath and five on the out-breath while you stand in line at the store, six rounds.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 77, 'Press your palm lightly on your belly button and breathe so your hand moves outward, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 78, 'Let the air out through gently pursed lips, slow and steady, as if blowing on a candle without putting it out, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 79, 'Mouth closed, hum on the out-breath like a quiet bee for four breaths, then sit in the silence after.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 80, 'Feel the slight coolness of the inhale at the back of your throat for six breaths while sitting on the couch.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 81, 'Take one slow breath each time you open a new browser tab or app this afternoon.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 82, 'Box breathe with small counts while waiting for a meeting to start: in two, rest two, out two, rest two, five rounds.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 83, 'Keep every breath in this practice easy and quiet; if a count feels like a strain, make it shorter.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 84, 'Lie on the floor with your knees bent and a hand on your chest, and feel the gentle rise for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 85, 'Make each out-breath one count longer than the last, starting at three and stopping at six.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 86, 'Watch your breath for one full minute as if it were clouds drifting by, letting it set its own pace.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 87, 'Notice the stillness just before your next in-breath begins, five times, without stretching it out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 88, 'On a walk, breathe in for two steps and out for three steps for two blocks.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 89, 'Lift your arms overhead slowly on a long inhale, then float them down on a longer exhale, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 90, 'Rub a sprig of mint, rosemary or basil between your fingers and take three breaths of its scent.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 91, 'Before you send a text you have been putting off, take two slow breaths with your hands off the keyboard.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 92, 'Make every doorway you walk through this morning a reminder to let one breath out slowly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 93, 'While stopped in traffic, eyes on the road, notice one breath in and let it go out without hurry.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 94, 'Before you eat dinner, take three breaths and notice the smell of the food in front of you.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 95, 'Rest a hand on your pet''s side and feel their breathing for a minute while you slow your own.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 96, 'Open a window for five minutes and stand beside it, breathing the outside air slowly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 97, 'Find an instrumental track with a slow beat and breathe in for four beats and out for six, for two minutes.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 98, 'Let the steam of a hot shower fill the room and breathe it in slowly for five breaths before you step out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 99, 'Turn off the light, lie on your side, and let your exhale soften a little more with each of ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 100, 'Stretch in bed on waking, then take three breaths while feeling the mattress under you.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 101, 'While you wait to be called at an appointment, rest your hands in your lap and breathe in for three and out for five.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 102, 'Pause before you walk into a tough meeting and take one long exhale through your mouth.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 103, 'Cool down after climbing stairs by breathing out slowly through pursed lips for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 104, 'Rake leaves or walk through them this fall and take three slow breaths of the crisp air.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 105, 'Smell the flower, blow out the candle: hold up a finger as the candle and play it with a child before bedtime.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 106, 'Pair the words let and go with your breath, let on the inhale and go on the exhale, for ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 107, 'Wrap both arms around yourself in a gentle hug and feel your back widen as you breathe in, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 108, 'Sit near the back of the bus and quietly count your breaths for three stops.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 109, 'Rest your hands on the steering wheel in your parked car and take four breaths with your eyes closed.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 110, 'Breathe out with a soft, open-mouthed haa, like warming your hands, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 111, 'In two, out four, again and again for one minute while the microwave runs.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 112, 'Run a fingertip slowly along the edge of your desk as you breathe out, then back as you breathe in, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 113, 'Check whether your breath is high in your chest or low in your belly right now, and invite it a little lower for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 114, 'Hold a cup of hot cocoa or tea with both hands and breathe in its warmth for four breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 115, 'From five down to one, count one number on each slow exhale before you start a new task.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 116, 'Roll your shoulders back gently on an inhale and let them settle on the exhale, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 117, 'Imagine your breath as a slow swing moving forward and back, and ride it for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 118, 'Feel your heels on the floor as you breathe in and the balls of your feet as you breathe out, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 119, 'Breathe through your nose only, softly, for two minutes while you read something light.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 120, 'Listen to a ticking clock and let each out-breath last about six ticks, for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 121, 'Rest a small pillow on your belly as you lie down and watch it move for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 122, 'Every time you sit down in the car today, pause for one breath before you buckle up.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 123, 'Sit with your hands open on your thighs, palms up, and take six slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 124, 'Before you walk into a party or gathering, take two easy breaths on the doorstep.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 125, 'Notice your breathing in this exact moment, then let your next exhale be a little softer.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 126, 'Sit on a porch or balcony on a warm night and take eight slow breaths of the evening air.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 127, 'Close your eyes and listen for the very end of each exhale, five breaths in a row.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 128, 'Before you start cooking, breathe in through your nose for four and sigh it out, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 129, 'Settle one hand low on your belly and one on your heart and breathe into the lower hand, eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 130, 'Rinse your face with cool water and take two slow breaths before you reach for the towel.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 131, 'Rest your elbows on the table and your chin in your hands for four calm breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 132, 'Hum one note on your out-breath while you fold laundry, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 133, 'Stand at the bathroom sink tonight and take three breaths while looking at your own eyes kindly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 134, 'Pull into a parking spot, turn off the engine, and take three slow breaths before you open the door.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 135, 'Breathe in a soft blue and out a warm gold in your mind, for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 136, 'Fog an imaginary mirror with your out-breath, slowly and softly, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 137, 'While a video buffers or an ad plays, take one slow breath and let your hands go loose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 138, 'Curl your fingers in gently on the in-breath and open them on the out-breath, eight times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 139, 'Look at the horizon, a rooftop or the sky, and take five breaths while letting your eyes soften.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 140, 'Before you step into class or the office, rest a hand on the door handle and take one slow breath.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 141, 'Count four breaths where you notice only the warm air leaving your mouth.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 142, 'Unclench your belly muscles and let it be round as you take five easy breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 143, 'Listen to the rain on the roof or window and let five out-breaths match its soft sound.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 144, 'If any practice feels uncomfortable, let it go and breathe in whatever way feels natural to you.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 145, 'On waking, breathe in while you stretch your fingers and toes, and breathe out as they relax, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 146, 'Take a few slow breaths near a tree, a plant or a garden, smelling whatever is growing there.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 147, 'Exhale for twice as long as you inhale, in for two and out for four, eight times while sitting at your desk.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 148, 'Lay both hands on your lower belly while lying in bed and let them ride up and down for ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 149, 'Give a long, soft sigh after you put your bag down at home, then take two ordinary breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 150, 'Tally your breaths on your fingers, one finger per out-breath, until you have counted both hands.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 151, 'Blow out gently through rounded lips as though cooling a hot drink, five times, while the drink cools.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 152, 'Let a soft mmm sound come out on each exhale for six breaths, feeling it in your lips.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 153, 'Track the temperature of your breath for five rounds: cooler going in, warmer coming out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 154, 'When your inbox opens, look away from it for three breaths before you read the first message.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 155, 'Use a tiny box breath before bed: in three, rest three, out three, rest three, three rounds only.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 156, 'There is no right way to do these practices; breathe slowly in whatever way feels comfortable today.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 157, 'Sit up straight in a chair, one palm on your breastbone, and feel it move for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 158, 'Breathe in normally, then let the out-breath trail off slowly like a fading note, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 159, 'Watch ten breaths go by while you sit on a bench, park or porch, counting only the exhales.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 160, 'Let the pause after you breathe out last as long as it naturally wants to, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 161, 'Match your breath to an easy stroll: in for four steps, out for four steps, around one block.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 162, 'Reach your arms forward as you breathe in and draw them back to your chest as you breathe out, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 163, 'Open a jar of a spice you like, cinnamon or cloves, and breathe its scent slowly three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 164, 'Let the phone ring once more before answering and use that ring for one slow breath.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 165, 'Pause under the doorframe of your bedroom tonight and let one breath out longer than it came in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 166, 'Sitting at a stop sign with your eyes on the road, let your shoulders drop as you breathe out once.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 167, 'Smell your morning toast or oatmeal before eating and take two slow breaths over it.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 168, 'Lie on the floor next to your pet and breathe slowly while you listen to them rest.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 169, 'Stand on a balcony, step or sidewalk for one minute and breathe in the outside air through your nose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 170, 'Play a quiet piano piece and let your breath follow its slowest phrases for two minutes.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 171, 'Breathe in the warm, damp air of the shower for four breaths before you turn the water off.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 172, 'Settle under the covers and count each out-breath backward from ten to one.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 173, 'Sit up slowly on waking and take three breaths before your feet touch the floor.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 174, 'Notice your breath while you wait at the pharmacy counter, and let each exhale be unhurried.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 175, 'Take a long out-breath through your mouth just before you say the first words of a hard conversation.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 176, 'Walk slowly for two minutes after a run or bike ride and breathe out a little longer with each step.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 177, 'Breathe in the smell of fallen leaves on an autumn walk, four slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 178, 'Make a game of it with a child: smell the soup, cool the soup, five slow rounds together.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 179, 'Breathe in thinking soft, breathe out thinking slow, for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 180, 'Rest your hands on the back of your ribs and feel them move a little as you breathe in, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 181, 'On the train, let your breath slow down to the rhythm of the wheels for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 182, 'In a parked car at the end of the day, take three breaths before you look at your phone.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 183, 'Breathe out with a quiet whoosh like a gentle wind, three times, then breathe normally.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 184, 'Count in for three and out for six, four times, while the shower water warms up.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 185, 'Draw a slow figure eight with your finger in the air, breathing in on one loop and out on the other, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 186, 'Notice whether your breath is quick or slow right now, then let the next five breaths settle a little.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 187, 'Breathe in the steam from a bowl of soup for three slow breaths before your first spoonful.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 188, 'Say the numbers silently from eight down to one, one per out-breath, before you leave the house.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 189, 'Let your jaw hang a little loose on an exhale and take four more breaths with it relaxed.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 190, 'Picture the tide rolling in as you breathe in and slipping back out as you breathe out, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 191, 'Press your feet into the floor as you breathe out and ease off as you breathe in, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 192, 'Close your mouth and breathe softly through your nose while you wash the dishes.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 193, 'Let each exhale last through two ticks of the second hand on a clock, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 194, 'Stretch out on the couch with your hands on your belly and feel them float for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 195, 'Each time you pour a drink today, take one slow breath while the glass fills.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 196, 'Rest your hands on the table, palms down, and take five slow breaths before a meal.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 197, 'Ahead of a phone or video interview, take three slow breaths with your feet flat on the floor.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 198, 'Notice the breath you are taking now, and then add one long, quiet sigh.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 199, 'On a warm summer morning, step outside barefoot on the grass for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 200, 'Listen for the sound of your breath at the tip of your nose, five quiet breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 201, 'Breathe in slowly for four, then let it go through your mouth with an easy sigh, three times before a meeting.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 202, 'Find the place where your breath moves most and rest a hand there for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 203, 'Pause after brushing your hair and take two breaths, letting your shoulders soften.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 204, 'Lean your back against a wall and take five breaths, feeling your ribs move against it.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 205, 'Hum on the out-breath while you wait for water to boil, five slow hums.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 206, 'Sit on the edge of the tub or bed after a long day and breathe out slowly three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 207, 'In the grocery store parking lot, take three breaths before you start the engine.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 208, 'Imagine breathing in a soft green and breathing out anything you do not need, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 209, 'Breathe out softly through your mouth as if steaming up cold glass, five gentle times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 210, 'While waiting for a printer or a copier, let two breaths go out slowly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 211, 'Spread your toes on the in-breath and let them relax on the out-breath, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 212, 'Look at something green outside and take four breaths while your eyes rest on it.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 213, 'At the school gate or office lobby, take two slow breaths before you walk in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 214, 'Count five breaths in which you feel only the rise of your belly.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 215, 'Let your stomach go slack and soft for six breaths while sitting at your desk.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 216, 'Watch raindrops slide down a window and breathe out slowly as each one falls, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 217, 'If you feel lightheaded, return to your everyday breathing and rest for a moment; that is part of the practice too.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 218, 'Stand at an open window first thing in the morning and take five slow breaths of the new day.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 219, 'Go outside after sunset and breathe the evening air slowly for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 220, 'Slow your exhale on purpose while you wait for your computer to start, in for three and out for five.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 221, 'Kneel or sit on your heels with a hand on your belly and breathe into your hand for six breaths.'),
