  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 238, 'Let the front door be your reminder today: one slow breath every time you go through it.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 239, 'Waiting at a railroad crossing, eyes ahead, breathe out a little longer than you breathe in, once or twice.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 240, 'Breathe in the smell of fresh bread, fruit or herbs before a snack, three slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 241, 'Brush your pet slowly and let your breath follow the long strokes for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 242, 'Take your morning drink outside and breathe the fresh air slowly between sips.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 243, 'Lie down with a slow song playing and breathe in on the verse and out on the chorus.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 244, 'Turn your face toward the shower spray and breathe out slowly through your mouth three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 245, 'Lying in the dark, picture your breath as a soft tide and follow ten of them in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 246, 'Open your eyes in the morning and take two slow breaths before you check the time.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 247, 'Sitting in the vet''s or doctor''s waiting room, take six slow breaths with your feet flat on the floor.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 248, 'Rest your hand on your belly for three breaths before you call someone back about something hard.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 249, 'After gentle yoga or stretching, lie still and let your breathing slow with a few long exhales.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 250, 'Stand in the cool morning air of fall and breathe out slowly to see if your breath makes a small cloud.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 251, 'With a toddler, pretend to smell a flower and blow on a dandelion, three slow rounds.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 252, 'Use the words breathing in and breathing out silently for ten slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 253, 'Rest one hand on the back of your neck and feel it soften as you breathe out, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 254, 'Waiting at the bus stop, take six slow breaths while watching the street.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 255, 'Turn off the radio in your parked car and take five breaths in the quiet.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 256, 'Let out a long, gentle hhh sound on the exhale, like a quiet tire letting out air, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 257, 'In for four, out for seven, three rounds, while you sit on the edge of the bed.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 258, 'Slide your hands slowly down your thighs as you breathe out and back up as you breathe in, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 259, 'Notice whether you are breathing through your nose or mouth right now, and try five breaths through your nose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 260, 'Cup a warm bowl of rice or noodles in both hands and take three breaths of its scent.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 261, 'Count from one to four on each exhale, gently, for a minute while lying down.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 262, 'Unclench your hands on the out-breath and let them rest open for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 263, 'Picture leaves drifting on a slow stream, one leaf for each breath out, eight leaves.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 264, 'Feel your seat under you as you breathe out and the top of your head as you breathe in, six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 265, 'Breathe through your nose while you water the plants, slow and easy.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 266, 'Let each out-breath last about as long as a slow drip from the faucet, four breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 267, 'Settle into bed, lay your hands across your belly, and watch them rise for ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 268, 'Each time you put on your shoes today, take one long, easy breath.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 269, 'Settle your back against the chair and take six breaths with your hands in your lap.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 270, 'Before you speak up in a group, take one slow breath and let it out through your mouth.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 271, 'Check in with your breath for a moment and let the next one go out like a slow wave.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 272, 'On a hot afternoon, sit in the shade and breathe slowly for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 273, 'Listen for the soft sound your breath makes at the back of your throat, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 274, 'Breathe in through your nose and sigh it out through your mouth before each meal, two times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 275, 'Find your breath with a hand on each side of your waist and breathe into both hands, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 276, 'Pause after putting on lotion and take two breaths with your hands resting on your arms.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 277, 'Rest your head back against the couch and take five breaths with your eyes closed.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 278, 'Hum softly on the out-breath while you walk down a hallway.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 279, 'Take three slow breaths in the shower before you start washing.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 280, 'Before you start the car in the morning, take two slow breaths with your hands in your lap.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 281, 'Imagine each in-breath as cool water and each out-breath as warm sunshine, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 282, 'Breathe out softly onto your cold hands to warm them, four slow times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 283, 'Use the time a download takes for two slow, quiet breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 284, 'Make loose fists on the in-breath and let your hands open on the out-breath, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 285, 'Gaze at clouds moving across the sky and take five slow breaths while watching them.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 286, 'Walking into a store or appointment, take one breath at the entrance before going in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 287, 'Count six breaths in which you only notice your chest rising and falling.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 288, 'Relax your stomach completely for five breaths while lying down.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 289, 'Breathe in the smell of wet pavement after a summer storm, four slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 290, 'Go gently: if counting makes you tense, stop counting and just let the exhale be soft.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 291, 'On waking, roll onto your side and take three slow breaths before you sit up.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 292, 'Stand under a tree and breathe slowly for one minute while you listen to the leaves.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 293, 'Lengthen just your next three exhales while you wait for a reply, and see whether it helps you feel a little calmer.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 294, 'Curl up on your side with a hand on your belly and feel it press gently into your palm for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 295, 'Allow yourself two slow sighs after you finish a hard task, then go on.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 296, 'Count your breaths up to twelve while sitting in a quiet corner, starting again if you drift.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 297, 'Cool an imaginary cup of cocoa with three slow, steady breaths through pursed lips.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 298, 'Hum the first line of a lullaby on one long out-breath, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 299, 'Sense the air passing in and out of each nostril for six breaths while sitting still.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 300, 'Look up from your screen every hour this afternoon for one long, easy breath.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 301, 'Breathe in a small box at the bus stop: in two, rest two, out three, rest two, four rounds.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 302, 'Some people find slow breathing helps them feel a little calmer; treat today''s few breaths as an easy experiment.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 303, 'Rest your hand on your heart while sitting in your car, parked, and feel your chest rise for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 304, 'Ease the air out slowly through your nose, taking a bit longer each time, for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 305, 'Keep company with your breath for ten rounds while you sit with your morning coffee.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 306, 'Linger in the soft pause at the bottom of each breath for five breaths before bed.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 307, 'Breathe out on every fourth step as you walk to your car or bus, for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 308, 'Raise one arm slowly with the in-breath and lower it with the out-breath, then switch arms, four times each.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 309, 'Breathe in the scent of a clean towel, fresh laundry or a bar of soap for three slow breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 310, 'Pause with your hand on the mouse before opening a hard email and take three breaths first.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 311, 'Every door you open at work today can be one slow breath out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 312, 'Breathe slowly at a long red light, eyes on the road and hands on the wheel, letting your grip soften.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 313, 'Before your first bite of breakfast, take two breaths and look at the colors on your plate.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 314, 'Sit with a pet on your lap and take ten slow breaths while you stroke them.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 315, 'Open a window or step onto a porch at night and breathe in the cool air for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 316, 'Breathe with a slow song on headphones while you walk, in for one beat, out for two.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 317, 'Stand in the shower and breathe in for three, out for five, three rounds, as the water runs over your back.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 318, 'Lying in bed, let each exhale feel like sinking a little further into the mattress, ten breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 319, 'Wake up and place your hands on your belly for three slow breaths before you move.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 320, 'Sitting in a waiting area, count the out-breaths until your name is called.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 321, 'Before you bring up something difficult with someone, take one breath and feel your feet.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 322, 'Cool down after dancing or playing a sport by sitting and letting each breath out a little longer.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 323, 'On a crisp fall day, breathe in through your nose and notice the cold, then breathe out warm, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 324, 'Practice smell the cookies, blow on the cookies with a child: a slow sniff in, a slow blow out, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 325, 'Silently say in as you breathe in and out as you breathe out, for one minute.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 326, 'Rest your palms on your lower back and feel it widen as you breathe in, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 327, 'On a long bus ride, close your eyes for two stops and follow your breath.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 328, 'Park, unbuckle, and take three slow breaths before you check anything.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 329, 'Breathe out with a soft sss sound, like a slow leak, three gentle times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 330, 'Breathe in for one and out for two, then in for two and out for three, then in for three and out for four.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 331, 'Slide one palm up your forearm as you breathe in and back down as you breathe out, four times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 332, 'Notice whether your shoulders rise when you breathe in, and let them stay low for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 333, 'Hold a peeled clementine near your nose and breathe its scent three slow times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 334, 'Count down from six on each exhale before you leave your desk for lunch.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 335, 'Breathe out and let your forehead smooth, then take three more soft breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 336, 'Picture a lantern glowing a little brighter on each in-breath and dimmer on each out-breath, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 337, 'Feel your hands on your knees as you breathe in and your feet on the floor as you breathe out, five times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 338, 'Breathe gently through your nose while you stir a pot or wipe a counter.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 339, 'Let your out-breath last as long as one slow swing of a porch swing or rocking chair, four breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 340, 'Lay your hands on your belly in a reclining chair and feel them rise for eight breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 341, 'Each time you take a sip of water today, take one slow breath first.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 342, 'Sit with your feet flat and hands loose and take five long breaths out.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 343, 'Before you hand in a test or a report, take one slow breath and let it go.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 344, 'Notice your next breath, and let the one after it be slower.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 345, 'On a summer night, lie on a blanket outside and breathe slowly while you look up.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 346, 'Hear the quiet sound of air leaving your nose for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 347, 'Breathe in for four and let a slow sigh carry it out, three times after you hang up the phone.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 348, 'Discover where your breath is easiest to feel today and rest your attention there for six breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 349, 'Pause after you tie your shoes and take two breaths before you stand.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 350, 'Rest your head on your folded arms at a table and breathe slowly for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 351, 'While the bath fills, hum softly on each out-breath, five slow hums.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 352, 'Breathe slowly in a warm bath for one minute, letting the out-breaths be long.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 353, 'Before you pull out of a parking spot, take two slow breaths with the car in park.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 354, 'Imagine your breath as a soft light filling your chest and leaving through your mouth, five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 355, 'Breathe out on a cold windowpane and watch the small cloud fade, three slow times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 356, 'While a song loads or a page refreshes, take two quiet breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 357, 'Press your fingertips together on the in-breath and let them part on the out-breath, six times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 358, 'Watch a candle flame or a lamp from a safe distance and breathe slowly for five breaths.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 359, 'Arriving home, rest your hand on the door for one slow breath before you go in.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 360, 'Feel only your back against the chair for six breaths, letting everything else wait.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 361, 'Soften your belly for five breaths while standing at the sink.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 362, 'Smell the first snow or the cold winter air on your doorstep, three slow breaths through your nose.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 363, 'Stop and breathe normally any time a practice makes you dizzy; slow and gentle is always enough.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 364, 'Open your eyes slowly on waking as you breathe in, and look around the room as you breathe out, three times.'),
  ('breathing-a-little-easier', 365, 'Look back over this challenge and choose one simple breathing practice to keep as your own.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
